      "rev_n_2_52b487_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_52b487_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_52b487",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the number of schools that need to be made up to ensure k Chosen Ones are selected",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794531696.4798217
      },
      "rev_n_3_4f0669_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_4f0669_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_4f0669",
        "thought_text": "Consider the power of students in each school and how changing a student's school affects the selection",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794531696.4798295
      },
      "rev_n_1_10e84f_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_10e84f_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_10e84f",
        "thought_text": "I understand the issue. The current implementation incorrectly calculates the number of additional schools needed. It should be the maximum of 0 and (k - len(current_strongest)), but the code is just calculating k - len(current_strongest). This can lead to negative results when k is less than the number of current strongest schools. Let's modify the reasoning step to address this issue.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_10e84f_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_3a8ad99da8",
        "created_at": 1794531726.4331267
      },
      "rev_n_3_4f0669_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_4f0669_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_4f0669",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is correct in its logic but has an error in the final return statement. Instead of returning 0 when we still need to make up new schools, we should return the number of additional schools needed (additional_schools_needed). This oversight causes the function to incorrectly report that no new schools are needed when in fact they are.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_4f0669_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_db7ea2122c",
        "created_at": 1794531766.27491
      },
      "rev_n_4_221854_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_221854_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_221854",
        "thought_text": "Identify the current strongest student in each school",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "8690761820484207033",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794531781.0403636
      },
      "rev_n_5_4345ef_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_4345ef_0",
        "node_id": "n_5_4345ef",
        "thought_text": "Determine which schools are missing from the list of schools with Chosen Ones",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "8690761820484207033",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794531781.0403793
      },
      "rev_n_6_8ae7d0_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_8ae7d0_0",
        "node_id": "n_6_8ae7d0",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the number of additional schools needed to ensure k Chosen Ones are selected",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "8690761820484207033",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794531781.0403879
      },
      "rev_n_6_8ae7d0_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_8ae7d0_1",
        "node_id": "n_6_8ae7d0",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous reasoning was that it didn't account for the case where a chosen one might already be the strongest in their school. Let's refine the thought process:\n\nThought-2 (refined): Calculate the number of additional schools needed by considering both the current strongest students in each school and the chosen ones, ensuring that each chosen one is either already the strongest or can be made the strongest by creating a new school.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "8690761820484207033",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_6_8ae7d0_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_022ec80983",
        "created_at": 1794531801.8720548
      },
      "rev_n_7_f719b0_0": {
